  unitName: Silent Strength Gilbert
  unitId: 840958
  unitNumber: 8641
  description: When Sheriff Gilbert learned that a young boy from the tribe that
    protected the mines had been kidnapped by a gang of bandits, his rage shook the
    heavens. As he and the young girl with the relic gun approached the bandits'
    hideout, the courage of the young hostage would prove to be the ace up their
    sleeve that would lead them to victory. After rescuing the young boy the locals
    who feared Gilbert had a change of heart, making the sheriff's heart swell with
    pride. Not only did he manage to capture the bandits that attacked his town,
    he was regarded as a hero and keeper of the peace ever since.
  summonDesc: Who made you cry?<br> I'll give 'em a stern talkin' to when I capture
    'em!<br>Wonder how tough they'll be then. Ha ha ha!
  fusionDesc: Oh, I can hear 'em!<br>People chantin' my name!<br>Feels like my heart's
    about to burst, and my shirt with it!
  evoDesc: You just watch, I'll make this desert bloom with flowers and smiles!<br>Hope
    you'll be smilin' then, from the bottom of your heart.
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
